menuconfig SOUNDSENSE
    bool "SoundSense abnormal-sound detection (cry/snoring)"
    default y
    help
      Stream microphone PCM to a LAN SoundSense server over WebSocket
      (docs/SoundSense_PROTOCOL.md) and surface snoring/baby_cry events.

if SOUNDSENSE

config SOUNDSENSE_SCREEN
    bool "Auto screen blanking + event wake"
    default y
    help
      Blank the panel after inactivity (30 s daytime / 10 s after 22:00),
      wake on button/voice/detection events.

endif
